title: Mum
tags: history
---

Mumma: Happy 20th my beautiful boy! I've got cake and a roast just for you when you come by. <3 Love mum!~

Player: Mum you don't need to sign your messages. This isn't an email.

Player: Thanks and food sounds good. I'll pop round on Tuesday

Mumma: Good! Don't eat too much during the day, plenty at ours.
--

Player: Did dad block me again? Messages keep bouncing back

Mumma: I told you I'm not going to get involved between the two of you. You're both big boys now.

Player: C'mon mum, I need to top up my phone credit. I'm just a coupla bucks short

Mumma: We're not made of money, honey.

Player: Join the club!

Mumma: I'll send you 10 but don't tell your father

Player: Thanks mum.

Player: Actually, can you make it 20?

Mumma: Sure, sweetheart.

--

Player: Happy birthday mum, sorry I couldn't come tonight. I'll take you to Solana's next week, my treat.

--

Mumma: So when are we going to Solana's?

Player: Huh?

Mumma: You promised me a Solana's dinner. It's been three weeks.

Player: Oh sure. I can take you tomorrow. 

Mumma: Your treat?

Player: Sure. Just don't get the anti-pasto platter again or I won't get groceries for a week.

